{
  // 實機裝置設定範例 / Sample real-device settings.
  //
  // 用法 / How to use:
  // 把本檔複製成執行檔旁的 device.json 並填入現場數值。切換不需要重新編譯。
  // device.json 存在 → 依內容接實機；不存在 → 程式拒絕啟動,並顯示它找過的路徑。
  // 不會退回模擬 —— 模擬判定與實機結果在畫面上分不出來,不該由「檔案漏放」觸發。
  // 沒有裝置而只想看畫面時,以 --mock 啟動（標題列會標示,判定非量測結果）。
  // Copy this to device.json next to the executable and fill in the line's values; no rebuild.
  // Present → the real devices named here; absent → the program refuses to start and shows the
  // path it searched. It does not fall back to mocks: mock verdicts are indistinguishable from
  // real ones on screen and must not be triggered by a misplaced file. To view the UI with no
  // devices, start with --mock (the title bar says so, and the verdicts are not measurements).
  //
  // 兩台裝置各自獨立 / The two devices are independent:
  // CodeReader（SR-X300 讀碼器）必填。
  // CharacterVerifier（IV4 字符檢測）在還沒導入時「整段刪掉」，不要留一段空的。
  //   此時配方的字符區域數要設為 0，否則每張標籤都會以「區域數不足」判退。
  // CodeReader is required. Delete the whole CharacterVerifier section while there is no IV4 yet
  // rather than leaving an empty one; the recipe's region count must then be 0, or every label
  // rejects on the region count.
  //
  // 怎麼確認欄位索引 / How to confirm the field indexes:
  // 按一次「單次觸發」，操作訊息區會出現「電文 / frame [裝置名稱]: ...」，那是裝置送回來的
  // 原始字串。數一數它的欄位（由 0 起算），再把索引對上去。兩台裝置各有自己的一行。
  // 設定錯誤的表徵是「每張標籤都判退」，那與印刷不良、與感測器沒對焦看起來一模一樣，
  // 所以請一定先看電文再調索引，不要憑判定結果猜。
  // Press Trigger once and the log pane shows "電文 / frame [device]: ..." — the raw string the
  // device sent, one line per device. Count its fields (zero-based) and match the indexes. A wrong
  // layout presents as "every label rejects", which looks exactly like bad print and exactly like
  // a sensor out of focus, so read the frame first rather than guessing from the verdicts.

  // ── 兩站的物理距離 / The physical distance between the stations ──
  //
  // 讀碼站到字符檢測站之間，料帶要走幾個脈波。字符檢測器鎖在固定位置，所以這個距離
  // 一輩子不變 —— 它是機構事實，屬於本檔。
  // How many pulses the web travels from the reading station to the verification station. The verifier is
  // bolted in one place, so this distance never changes: a mechanical fact, and this file's business.
  //
  // 「相隔幾格」由程式自己算（本值 ÷ 配方的一格脈波數），不必人工換算。
  // 同一個距離，標籤短就是多格、標籤長就是少格 —— 所以格數屬於配方而不是本檔。
  // 換機種只要在主畫面改「一格脈波」，偏移就自動跟著對。
  // The pitch count is derived by the program, dividing this by the recipe's pulses per feed, with no manual
  // conversion. The same distance is more pitches with short labels and fewer with long ones, so the count
  // belongs to the recipe rather than here: a changeover edits the pulses per feed on the main screen and
  // the offset follows.
  //
  // 尚未導入字符檢測（device.json 沒有 CharacterVerifier 那一段）時可以整行省略。
  // 有 CharacterVerifier 時則「必填」，即使是 0 —— 0 表示兩台瞄同一個位置。
  // 為什麼不預設 0：漏填而被當成 0 的後果是每一筆紀錄都把讀碼站看到的第 N 張與檢測站
  // 看到的第 N−k 張湊在一起，不報錯、良率正常、每一筆看起來都完整。
  // Omit the line entirely while there is no CharacterVerifier section. With one present it is required,
  // even as 0, which means both sensors look at the same position. It has no default because an omission
  // taken as zero would pair the reading station's label N with the verification station's label N−k in
  // every record — no error, a normal yield, every row looking complete.
  //
  // 除不盡時感測器沒有落在標籤邊界上，程式會取最接近的格數並在初始化訊息裡說出來。
  // 那通常代表兩個數字之一填錯了。
  // A remainder means the sensor does not sit on a label boundary; the program uses the nearest count and
  // says so in the initialise log. It usually means one of the two numbers is wrong.
  //
  // 現場會看到的行為：初始化後前 k 次觸發只掃碼、不產生紀錄，訊息區顯示「標籤前進中」，
  // 第 k+1 次才出現第一筆判定。停機時兩站之間那 k 張會被作廢並在訊息區報出張數。
  // What the line sees: after initialising, the first k triggers only scan and produce no record, the log
  // says the label is advancing, and the first verdict appears on trigger k+1. On a stop the k labels
  // between the stations are voided and their count is reported.
  //
  // "InspectionStationDistancePulses": 40000,

  "CodeReader": {
    // Keyence SR-X300。設定軟體：AutoID Network Navigator → 乙太網頁籤。
    // 讀碼器必須設成 TCP 伺服器；設成客戶端的話它不會在任何埠等待，
    // 症狀是「拒絕連線」且掃不到任何開著的資料埠。
    // Configured from AutoID Network Navigator, Ethernet tab. The reader has to be a TCP server;
    // as a client it listens on nothing, and the symptom is a refused connection with no data port
    // open anywhere.
    "Host": "192.168.1.10",

    // 埠號在乙太網頁籤的「設定小幫手」或「設定清單」裡，不在 IP 設定那一頁。
    // 改完記得按「設定傳送」寫進讀碼器，否則實機行為不會變。
    // The port lives in the Ethernet tab's setup wizard or parameter list, not on the IP page.
    // Remember to transmit the settings to the reader afterwards or nothing changes on the device.
    "Port": 9004,

    // 觸發命令，不含結束字元。沒有預設值 —— 請照裝置通訊規格書填，程式無從猜測。
    // 命令錯誤的表徵是「裝置完全不回應」，與網路不通、與裝置沒開機分不出來。
    // Trigger command without its terminator. No default: take it from the device's communication
    // spec, because the program cannot guess. A wrong command presents as "the device never
    // answers", indistinguishable from a dead link or an unpowered device.
    "TriggerCommand": "LON",

    // Cr / Lf / CrLf。實機為 CR,見設定軟體「終端」欄。
    // The hardware uses CR; see the Terminator row in the setup software.
    "Terminator": "Cr",

    // 分隔符（附加數據）—— 條碼與其附加資料之間。實機為冒號。
    // The appended-data delimiter, between a code and its appended items. The hardware uses a colon.
    "FieldDelimiter": ":",

    "ConnectTimeoutMs": 5000,

    // 逾時有三層，順序必須是「讀碼器 < 本項 < 協調器」：
    //   讀碼器端的讀取時限   最短 —— 讀不到就回答，讓它變成一次判退
    //   ResponseTimeoutMs   中間 —— 裝置真的沉默才觸發，訊息說得出是哪一台
    //   CodeReadTimeout     最長（程式內建 3 秒）
    // There are three timeouts and the order has to be reader, then this, then the sequencer:
    //   the reader's own read limit is shortest, so a failed read is answered and becomes a reject;
    //   ResponseTimeoutMs fires only when the device is genuinely silent, and names it;
    //   CodeReadTimeout, three seconds in code, is the outermost guard.
    //
    // 為什麼讀碼器那一層不能省：沒有標籤時 SR-X300 不回應，它會一直等到讀到東西為止。
    // 讀碼器沒有時限的話，「一張標籤漏貼」會走到本項逾時 → 設備故障 → 停線，
    // 而那應該是判退後繼續生產。實測就是這樣停下來的。
    // Why the reader's limit cannot be skipped: with no label present the SR-X300 does not answer at all,
    // it waits until it reads something. Without a limit there, one missing label reaches this timeout,
    // becomes an equipment fault and stops the line — when it should be a reject and carry on. That is
    // exactly how the line stopped in practice.
    //
    // 本程式刻意不把「裝置逾時」改判成不良品：真的沉默的裝置就是設備問題（斷線、沒開機、
    // 命令錯），當成不良品會讓斷線被記成一批壞標籤。要分辨兩者，只能靠讀碼器主動回答。
    // This program deliberately does not reclassify a device timeout as a bad part: a genuinely silent
    // device is an equipment problem — a dropped link, no power, the wrong command — and calling it a bad
    // part would log a dead link as a batch of defects. Only the reader answering can tell them apart.
    "ResponseTimeoutMs": 2000,

    // 以此開頭的電文視為裝置自身異常 → 停線，不會被記成一張不良標籤。
    // A frame starting with this is a device-level fault: stop the line, do not log a bad label.
    //
    // SR-X300 刻意停用（空字串）。實測讀不到時它輸出 "ERROR"，而那以 "ER" 開頭 ——
    // 沿用 "ER" 的話，「一張標籤漏貼」會被判成設備異常而停線，那應該是判退後繼續生產。
    // 而且遮住六張中的一張與遮住全部六張輸出相同，所以這是每批都會遇到的常態，不是例外。
    // Deliberately disabled for the SR-X300. In practice it emits "ERROR" on a failed read, which starts
    // with "ER": keeping that prefix turns one missing label into an equipment fault and stops the line,
    // when it should reject and carry on. Covering one of six labels produces the same output as covering
    // all six, so this is routine rather than exceptional.
    //
    // 代價：停用之後，讀碼器若另有一種真正的設備異常電文，那筆也會被當成「沒讀到」而判退。
    // 若日後量到那個字樣，填進本欄即可恢復停線。
    // The cost: a genuine device-fault frame, if one exists, also reads as a failed read and rejects. Should
    // one be measured later, putting it here restores the line stop.
    "ErrorPrefix": "",

    // 視為「該欄位沒有結果」的字樣，不分大小寫。空欄位一律視為沒有結果。
    // 讀不到的那一筆會落在這裡，於是不進結果清單，改由配方的筆數檢查判退 —— 那是漏貼標籤
    // 唯一會被抓到的地方。"ERROR" 是 SR-X300 實測的 no-read 字樣。
    // Tokens meaning "no result in this field", case-insensitive; an empty field always counts. A failed read
    // lands here, stays out of the result list, and is rejected by the recipe's count check — the one place a
    // missing label is caught. "ERROR" is the SR-X300's measured no-read token.
    "EmptyTokens": ["ERROR", "NG", "NOREAD", "----"],

    // ── 電文結構 / Frame structure ──
    //
    // 實機格式（AutoID Terminal 擷取）/ As captured from the hardware:
    //   2132030090A0S6X10683:-0.0,2132030090A0S6X10685:3.0,2132030090A0S6X10684:3.0[CR]
    //   └───── 一筆記錄 ──────┘  └───── 一筆記錄 ─────┘
    //        碼    :    等級      ↑ 記錄分隔符 / record delimiter
    //
    // 對應設定軟體「操作模式 → 數據編輯 → 讀取數據格式」那一頁：
    //   分隔符（附加數據）      → FieldDelimiter
    //   內部分隔符（讀取多個代碼）→ RecordDelimiter
    // These map to the reader's own Read data format page: the appended-data delimiter is
    // FieldDelimiter and the inter-code delimiter is RecordDelimiter.
    //
    // 兩者不可相同。填成同一個字元,兩層會塌成一層 —— 碼與等級被當成兩筆條碼,
    // 筆數變成兩倍,而等級整批消失。程式在啟動時會擋下這種設定。
    // They must differ: one character for both collapses the two levels, a code and its grade become two
    // codes, the count doubles and every grade disappears. The program refuses this at startup.
    "RecordDelimiter": ",",

    // 一筆記錄裡條碼的位置。報頭設為「無」時條碼在最前面,所以是 0。
    // Position of the code within one record. With the header set to none it comes first, so zero.
    "CodeField": 0,

    // 一筆記錄裡品質等級的位置；不讀等級時填 null。
    // 附加數據勾選 ISO/IEC 15415（二維）或 15416（一維）後,等級就排在條碼之後那一格。
    // 兩項可以同時勾選以兼容不同條碼類型,但一次讀取只會輸出其中一種,所以位置固定為 1。
    // Position of the quality grade within one record, or null to read none. With ISO/IEC 15415 (2D) or
    // 15416 (1D) ticked in the appended data, the grade sits in the field after the code. Both may be
    // ticked to cover different symbol types, yet one read emits only one of them, so the position is 1.
    //
    // 等級必須設成「數值」輸出,不能用字母。字母（A/B/C/D）無法與配方的整數門檻比較,
    // 解析後為 null,配方若啟用等級檢查會判退「未輸出品質等級」。
    // The grade has to be configured as numeric output rather than letters: letters cannot be compared with
    // the recipe's integer threshold, parse to null, and make a recipe with grade checking enabled reject
    // with "no grade reported".
    //
    // 實測輸出帶小數位（"3.0"),程式會向下取整;「未評估」輸出 -0.0,程式視為「沒有等級」
    // 而非「等級 0」—— 0 在 ISO 刻度上是最差的合格等級,兩者判退原因不同。
    // The hardware emits a decimal place ("3.0") and the program floors it. Not-evaluated comes back as
    // -0.0, which the program treats as no grade rather than grade zero: zero is the worst *valid* grade on
    // the ISO scale, and the two reject for different reasons.
    "GradeField": 1
  },

  // ── 字符檢測站 / The character-verification station ──
  //
  // IV4 已到貨並接上。尚未導入時整段刪掉（不要留一段空的），此時配方的字符區域數要設 0。
  // The IV4 has arrived and is attached. While absent, delete this whole section rather than leaving an
  // empty one, and set the recipe's region count to 0.
  //
  // 加上這一段之後，最外層的 InspectionStationDistancePulses 就「必須」填寫，否則程式拒絕啟動。
  // 導入期建議先填 0（表示兩台瞄同一位置），IV4 第一次觸發就會動，馬上看得到電文；
  // 量好格式之後再改成實際距離。
  // Adding this section makes the top-level InspectionStationDistancePulses required, or the program refuses
  // to start. During commissioning set it to 0, meaning both sensors on one position, so the IV4 fires on the
  // very first trigger and its frame appears at once; put the real distance in once the format is settled.
  "CharacterVerifier": {
    // Keyence IV4。與讀碼器是不同的裝置，位址、埠、命令、欄位全部各自獨立設定。
    // 不可與 CodeReader 填同一個位址加埠 —— 那幾乎一定是複製後忘了改，
    // 而多數工業裝置只接受一條連線，結果會是其中一台在初始化時被拒絕。
    // A different device from the reader, with its own address, port, command and fields. It must
    // not share an address and port with CodeReader: that is almost always an unedited copy, and
    // since most industrial devices accept only one link, one of them is refused at initialise.
    //
    // 以下三項為實機確認值 / Confirmed against the hardware:
    "Host": "192.168.1.41",
    "Port": 8500,
    "TriggerCommand": "T1",

    // 以下為「待實機確認」/ Still unconfirmed:
    //
    // 結束字元尚未確認。填錯的表徵是「埠連上了但在逾時內未回應」——
    // 驅動會一直等結束字元等不到。若出現該訊息而埠確實通，依序試 Lf、CrLf。
    // The terminator is not yet confirmed. Getting it wrong presents as "the port opened but nothing answered
    // in time", because the driver waits for a terminator that never arrives. If that message appears while
    // the port is demonstrably open, try Lf and then CrLf.
    "Terminator": "Cr",

    // 分隔字元尚未確認。SR-X300 的電文是「兩層」結構（記錄之間 ','，記錄內 ':'），
    // 而 IV4 同廠牌、設定軟體同一套邏輯，很可能也是兩層。
    // 目前的 CharacterFrameReader 只實作「單層」—— 那個假設在讀碼器身上已經錯過一次，
    // 讓第一筆之後的結果整批消失且不報錯。請務必先擷取實機電文再定，不要沿用此預設值。
    // The delimiter is not yet confirmed. The SR-X300's frame turned out to be two levels — commas between
    // records and colons within one — and the IV4 is the same make with the same setup software, so it may
    // well be two levels too. CharacterFrameReader currently implements only the flat model, an assumption
    // that already failed once on the reader and silently dropped everything past the first result. Capture a
    // real frame before settling this rather than trusting the default.
    "FieldDelimiter": ",",

    "ConnectTimeoutMs": 5000,

    // IV4 端也要設「檢測時限」，理由與讀碼器相同：辨識不到要「回答」而不是沉默。
    // 沉默會走到本項逾時 → 設備故障 → 停線，而字符辨識不到應該是判退。
    // The IV4 needs a detection time limit of its own, for the same reason as the reader: a failure to
    // recognise has to be answered rather than met with silence. Silence reaches this timeout, becomes an
    // equipment fault and stops the line, when an unrecognised character should be a reject.
    "ResponseTimeoutMs": 2000,

    // ⚠ 這兩項是獨立設定，不會沿用 SR-X300 的覆寫值。
    // 讀碼器因為 no-read 輸出 "ERROR"（以 "ER" 開頭）而停用了 ErrorPrefix；IV4 仍是預設 "ER"。
    // 若 IV4 辨識失敗的輸出也以 "ER" 開頭，一張字符不良的標籤會被判成設備異常而停線 ——
    // 而那應該是判退。請刻意遮掉字符量一次失敗電文，再決定這兩項。
    // These two are configured independently and do not inherit the SR-X300's overrides. The reader disabled
    // ErrorPrefix because its no-read token "ERROR" starts with "ER"; the IV4 still defaults to "ER". If the
    // IV4's failure output also starts with "ER", one label with bad characters becomes an equipment fault and
    // stops the line, when it should be a reject. Obscure the characters deliberately, capture the failure
    // frame, and then decide both values.
    "ErrorPrefix": "ER",
    "EmptyTokens": ["NG", "NOREAD", "----"],

    // 字符檢測各區域文字所在欄位。筆數要與配方的 ExpectedCharacterRegionCount 一致。
    // 目前的值是假設，必須以實機電文校正 —— 索引錯誤的表徵是「每張標籤都判退」，
    // 那與印刷不良、與感測器沒對焦看起來一模一樣。
    // Fields holding each OCR region's text; the count should match the recipe's
    // ExpectedCharacterRegionCount. These values are an assumption and must be corrected against a real
    // frame: a wrong index presents as "every label rejects", indistinguishable from bad print and from a
    // sensor out of focus.
    "CharacterTextFields": [1, 2]
  }
}
